-- a derived quantity: the reports it is computed from, indexed by whatever indexes them, and the
-- function that computes it from their values. The dependency is part of the quantity, so it cannot
-- be stored without it — which is what AFLOW, the Materials Project and OQMD do not store when they
-- publish formation energies that differ by up to 0.105 eV/atom from the same input structure, the
-- peak disagreement traced to a chosen elemental reference that every number downstream inherited.
Derived : (I : Type 0) → (V : Type 0) → (U : Type 0) → Type 1
Derived I V U = (rs : I → Report V) × ((I → V) → U)
